{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53739","headline":"皇恩寺（题拟） · 潘咸","name":"皇恩寺（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"睿（别本作「广」）泽潭来数百年，海山高处有只园。\n禅林自是三三（别本作「山」）界，尘世谁知十二门。\n诗客迢迢寻义路，禅翁特特（别本作「转」）起谈轩。\n香炉顶上垂东注，万派分明出一源。\n（见影印文渊阁《四库全书》本《淳熙三山志》卷三五，所注别本指上海图书馆藏清红格抄本。\n原署作者爲「潘诚」，今从《全唐诗》以咸爲正名。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘咸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}